&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;20&quot;&gt;What Is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5mi4s-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5mi4s-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5mi4s-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As a Public Sector Account Executive focused on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5mi4s-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Defence, the Ministry of Home Affairs (MHA), and Space Agencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5mi4s-0-2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, you will play a strategic role in expanding Elastic’s presence across India’s most mission-critical government institutions. You will build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders in government, defence, security, intelligence, and space. You will also gain a deep knowledge of their challenges related to operations, security, and data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5mi4s-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;eq8nt-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;eq8nt-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;eq8nt-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In this role, you will lead the entire sales process. This means finding strategic opportunities and building relationships with executives. You will shape solutions and create account strategies. Additionally, you will drive complex deals that involve multiple stakeholders. You will showcase Elastic’s features in Search, Observability, Security, SIEM, AI, and intelligent data platforms. This will help government organisations gain real-time visibility. It will also strengthen their ability to withstand cyber threats, accelerated up mission results, and unlock value from their data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;eq8nt-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ciprr-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ciprr-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ciprr-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You need to have a solid knowledge of the Defence, Homeland Security, Law Enforcement, Intelligence, and Space sectors. You should be able to interact with CXOs, senior government officials, technical leaders, and strategic partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7a81t-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7a81t-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7a81t-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;7a81t-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build and manage strategic relationships with senior stakeholders. This includes stakeholders in Defence, MHA, Space Agencies, and security and intelligence organisations. Understand their priorities. Position Elastic as a trusted technology partner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bsrc-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bsrc-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bsrc-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bsrc-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, identifying whitespace, new opportunities, expansion potential, and long-term growth across key government accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1vrem-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1vrem-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;1vrem-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Manage the entire sales process. This includes prospecting, discovery, and presenting solutions. You will also oversee proofs of concept, commercial negotiations, procurement, contracting, and closing deals. Drive customer value at every stage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;fdd7s-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;fdd7s-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;fdd7s-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive pipeline and revenue performance. Maintain a robust pipeline and ensure reliable CRM and forecasts. Manage opportunities in a disciplined way. Consistently meet sales targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1iqjc-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1iqjc-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;1iqjc-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Work with internal teams and partners to create engaging interactions with customers. This includes organising executive briefings, proposals, and solutions. Use customer insights and market information to drive growth and improve Elastic’s presence in the Public Sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1852&quot; data-end=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1852&quot; data-end=&quot;1870&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;esb4k-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;esb4k-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;esb4k-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;esb4k-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Solid Public Sector sales experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;esb4k-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, with a proven track record of leading revenue growth and securing strategic government contracts across Defence, MHA, Space, and related agencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;510vp-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;510vp-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;510vp-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A solid knowledge of how the government buys and procures is required. This includes comprehending complex processes, working with various stakeholders, managing tenders, using frameworks, and navigating lengthy sales cycles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;d6tal-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;d6tal-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;d6tal-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You should have solid skills in building relationships and managing stakeholders. You need to engage with and influence senior leaders in government, defence, security, and technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;31pac-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;31pac-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;31pac-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You must have solid consultative selling and communication skills. You should understand important requirements and present effective business and technology solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4ua3j-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4ua3j-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4ua3j-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proven ability to build and execute strategic account plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4ua3j-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, identify new opportunities, launch solutions, and expand strategic public sector accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;nsav&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;d8flm-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;d8flm-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;d8flm-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We prioritize our customers and their missions. Our goal is to align Elastic’s solutions with government priorities and initiatives. This way, we can deliver measurable outcomes in business, operations, security, and society.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
